[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_SUPPLY]
Cargo Hold

[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_SUPPLY_desc]
Try to shoot down enemy planes, maybe you will be lucky enough to see the donuts explode in the sky and the chocolate rain that follows. Of course, don’t open your mouth to catch the falling chocolate, because it could also be a cannonball... They seem smaller when they are far away... You know what I mean.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_SUPPLY]
货运舱

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_SUPPLY_desc]
试着击落敌军的飞机吧，也许你能有幸见到空中爆炸的甜甜圈和随之而来的巧克力雨。当然，不要张嘴去接掉下来的巧克力，因为也有可能是加农炮弹... 近大远小... 你懂的。
